{"name":"Lunge","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you attack with this weapon, you can increase its range by 5 feet. You can also use this mastery to increase the reach of your weapon for the purposes of satisfying trigger conditions of melee attacks you can make as a Reaction, e.g. Opportunity Attacks or the Battle Master's brace maneuver.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s026b707cb0e63ed","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Saturated","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to acid damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s047b31d20bde02a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Visions of Distant Realms","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Arcane Eye at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp","_id":"s04c1500b66120d0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shadow Stealth","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon gains Proficiency in the Stealth skill. If it is already proficient in the skill, it adds double your Proficiency bonus to checks it makes with it.</p><p>While in dim light or darkness, your Eidolon can take the Hide action as a Bonus Action.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":"while in dim light or darkness"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/silhouette-stealth-shadow.webp","_id":"s0610a49a2aa17de","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Staggering Strike","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to knock a target off-balance. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and if the target is Large or smaller, it must make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failed save, the target cannot take Bonus Actions or Reactions until the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s0620abdbc0db722","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Mind Sharpener","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The infused item can send a jolt to the wearer to refocus their mind. The item has 4 charges. When the wearer fails a Constitution Saving Throw to maintain Concentration on a spell, the wearer can use its Reaction to expend 1 of the item's charges to succeed instead. The item regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp","_id":"s06912915b3a7c5c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pack Leader","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Creatures summoned by you have Advantage on Attack Rolls against any creatures that they can see within 5 feet of your Eidolon, unless your Eidolon is Incapacitated.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/wolf-heads-swirl-purple.webp","_id":"s08403f2c6027d2f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Sweeping Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you make a melee weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to perform a powerful arcing swing around you. The original target and any other creature within your reach has to make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failure, a target takes damage equal to one roll of your superiority die.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s094366fb59da465","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Sculptor of Flesh","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Polymorph once. You can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s09eeaab7e08a51b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Twinned Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that targets only one creature and doesn't have a range of self, you can spend a number of sorcery points equal to the spell's level to target a second creature in range with the same spell (1 sorcery point if the spell is a cantrip).</p><p>To be eligible, a spell must be incapable of targeting more than one creature at the spell's current level. For example, Magic Missile and Scorching Ray aren't eligible, but Ray of Frost and Chromatic Orb are.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell that targets only one creature and doesn't have a range of self"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/lightning/bolt-strike-blue.webp","_id":"s0b8703541949f33","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Greater Size Increase","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon's size increases to huge and its hitpoints increase by an amount equal to your summoner level.</p><p>Additionally, the reach of its melee weapon attacks increases by 5 feet and the die size for its natural weapons and damaging abilities increases by 1 step.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-grow-shrink-tan.webp","_id":"s0c6d534497ceaf2","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Defense","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While you are wearing armor, you gain a +1 bonus to AC.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"s0c741fec32f4cce","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Hungry Vortex","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 5 kinesis points to cast Maelstrom, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s0c9c8c6bde49fff","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Under a Scarlet Sky","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 7 kinesis points to cast Fire Storm, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s0dc359bbd14513a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Soul Eater","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature that isn't a construct or undead is reduced to 0 hit points within 30 feet of you, you can use your Reaction to offer their life energy to your patron in exchange for power. Until the end of your next turn, you make attacks with Advantage and you have Resistance to all damage.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> Additionally, you regain an expended warlock spell slot. Once you've amplified this blood curse, you must finish a Long Rest before you can amplify it again.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when a creature that isn't a construct or undead is reduced to 0 hit points"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/unholy/strike-body-life-soul-green.webp","_id":"s1037ebeda5b110a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Rally","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend one Superiority Die to bolster the resolve of a companion. Choose an ally of yours within 30 feet of yourself who can see or hear you. That creature gains Temporary Hit Points equal to the Superiority Die roll plus half your Fighter level (round down).</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/heart-glowing-red.webp","_id":"s1095b9a5cc4da29","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Potency","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Strength score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. At 11th level in this class, both bonuses increase to 4. You can have only one Ability Score-increasing mutagen active on you at a time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s11971aeb55e036e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Kinetic Whip","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The reach of your kinetic blade doubles. Additionally, creatures provoke Opportunity Attacks from you if they move at least 5 ft within your reach.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-yellow-red.webp","_id":"s135589a51279580","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ultimate Pact Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can use any weapon you summon with your Pact of the Blade feature as a spellcasting focus for your warlock spells.</p><p>In addition, the weapon gains a +3 bonus to its attack and damage rolls, stacking with existing bonuses on the weapon except other Pact Weapon invocations, up to a maximum of +5 for the Attack Roll bonus.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"s1387bd1db04cd38","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Water Shaper","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Control Water, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/water-hand.webp","_id":"s1399b3005783315","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Mask of Many Faces","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Disguise Self at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s13e3b8790532461","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Distracting Strike","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to distract the creature, giving your allies an opening. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll. The next Attack Roll against the target by an attacker other than you has Advantage if the attack is made before the start of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s150a2a3a2e2b187","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eldritch Armor","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As an Action, you can touch a suit of armor that isn't being worn or carried by anyone and instantly don it, provided you aren't wearing armor already. You are proficient with this suit of armor until it's removed.</p><p>You also gain the benefits of the Armor Mastery for this armor, as per the Martial Mastery class feature.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"s150ea8c2eed82aa","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Investment of the Chain Master","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast Find Familiar, you infuse the summoned familiar with a measure of your eldritch power, granting the creature the following benefits:</p><ul><li>The familiar gains either a Fly Speed or a Swim Speed (your choice) of 40 feet.</li><li>The familiar's weapon attacks are considered magical for the purpose of overcoming Immunity and Resistance to nonmagical attacks.</li><li>If the familiar forces a creature to make a Saving Throw, it uses your spell save DC.</li><li>When the familiar takes damage, you can use your Reaction to grant it Resistance against that damage.</li><li>You can replace your familiar's Attack Roll bonus with your spell attack bonus if it is higher.</li><li>You can replace your familiar's hit point maximum with 5 x your Warlock level if it is higher.</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s15705312b8d7f58","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Extended Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that has a duration of 1 minute or longer, you can spend 1 sorcery point per duration step to increase its duration by 1 step, to a maximum duration of 24 hours. If the affected spell requires Concentration, you have Advantage on any Saving Throw you make to maintain that Concentration.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell that has a duration of 1 minute or longer"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/time/hourglass-yellow-green.webp","_id":"s17960420065f341","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1779654527365,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Damage Resistance","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon gains Resistance to one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, poison, or radiant.</p><p>This evolution feat can be selected multiple times.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"s17ef3ef7b33ac5b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Vermillion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you regain a Hit Die through your Crimson Rite, you can choose to regain a use of your Blood Maledict instead.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s17f5b2f8f77182c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Commanding Presence","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you make a Charisma (Intimidation), a Charisma (Performance), or a Charisma (Persuasion) check, you can expend one superiority die and add the superiority die to the Ability Check.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-sword-blue.webp","_id":"s18c9a54eb44907d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Anxious","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you harry the body or mind of a creature you can see within 30 feet of you, making them susceptible to mental influence. Until the end of your next turn, Charisma (Intimidation) checks made against the cursed creature have Advantage and whenever the target takes psychic damage, it takes additional damage of the same type equal to a roll of your hemocraft die.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The next Wisdom Saving Throw the cursed creature makes before this curse ends has Disadvantage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp","_id":"s18d3f52a133cba4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Incinerate","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 6 kinesis points to cast Disintegrate, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s1bbd60a203c9f42","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Special Senses","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon gains one of the following senses of your choice:</p><ul><li>Blindsight within 30 feet.</li><li>Tremorsense within 60 feet.</li><li>Devil's Sight within 120 feet.</li></ul><p>This evolution feat can be selected multiple times.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/mammals/humanoid-wolf-dog-blue.webp","_id":"s1bcaaed2847c54e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pact of the Chain","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You learn the Find Familiar spell and can cast it as a ritual. The spell doesn't count against your number of spells known.</p><p>When you cast the spell, you can choose one of the normal forms for your familiar or one of the following special forms: imp, pseudodragon, quasit, or sprite.</p><p>The familiar obeys your commands as best it can. It rolls for initiative like any other creature, but you determine its actions, decisions, attitudes, and so on. If you are Incapacitated or absent, your familiar acts on its own.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/debuff-chains-shackle-movement-red.webp","_id":"s1c49ff486e9d825","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591063,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Energy Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, poison, radiant, or thunder.</p><p>Your Eidolon's weapon attacks deal an additional 1d6 of the chosen damage type.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/fang-tooth-poison-green.webp","_id":"s1cd7dad2765b6b1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"The Master's Boon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose two ability scores from Strength, your Spellcasting Ability, and Constitution. The chosen ability scores and their maximums increase by 2.</p><p>Additionally, your average life expectancy is doubled.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s1d13c3a4912752c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Disarming Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to disarm the target, forcing it to drop one item of your choice that it's holding. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and the target must make a Strength Saving Throw. On a failed save, it drops the object you choose. The object lands at its feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s1d65fbf6243bf76","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fan of Flames","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>By spending an Action and 1 kinesis point, you can cause the energy of your kinetic shape to fan outward in a 30-foot cone. Every creature in the area of effect has to make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your save DC, taking your kinetic shape damage on a failure, and half as much on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s1ef87b623392ef9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Marked","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you mark a creature that you can see within 30 feet of you. Until the end of your turn, whenever you hit the cursed creature with a weapon for which you have an active crimson rite, you roll an additional hemocraft die when determining the extra damage from the rite.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The next Attack Roll you make against the target before the end of your turn has Advantage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/targeting/crosshair-mark-rough-pink.webp","_id":"s1f3561b435b9cef","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pact of the Tome","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your patron gives you a grimoire called a Book of Shadows. When you gain this feature, choose three cantrips from any class's spell list. The cantrips do not need to be from the same spell list. While the book is on your person, you can cast those cantrips at will. They don't count against your number of cantrips known. Any cantrip you cast with this feature is considered a warlock cantrip for you. If you lose your Book of Shadows, you can perform a 1-hour ceremony to receive a replacement from your patron. This ceremony can be performed during a Short or a Long Rest, and it destroys the previous book. The book turns to ash when you die.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/books/book-embossed-jewel-gold-purple.webp","_id":"s223c69a0cc43882","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591064,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Improved Pact Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can use any weapon you summon with your Pact of the Blade feature as a spellcasting focus for your warlock spells.</p><p>In addition, the weapon gains a +1 bonus to its attack and damage rolls, stacking with existing bonuses on the weapon, up to a maximum of +5 for the Attack Roll bonus.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"s22489bed464ff05","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Wings","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon gains a Fly Speed if it doesn't already have one, equal to its highest Speed.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/wing-batlike-purple-blue.webp","_id":"s2286d7ff759dc28","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591059,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Rapidity","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Speed increases by 10 feet. At 11th level in this class, it increases by an additional 10 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s2586c77524f77e4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blade Whirlwind","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As an Action, you can spend 2 kinesis points and make a melee attack against any number of creatures in range of your kinetic blade.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s259f19938fc452a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Draconic Companion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your familiar takes on draconic features and changes its creature type to dragon if it wasn't already one. It has Resistance against the damage type associated with your draconic patron. Additionally, its size increases to Medium.</p><p>As an Action, your familiar can exhale destructive energy in a 30 ft cone. Each creature in the area has to make a DEX Saving Throw against your Spell Save DC. A target takes damage of the type associated with your patron equal to 2d6 + an additional 1d6 x your Proficiency on a failed saved and half as much on a successful one.</p><p>Your familiar cannot use this action again until you have finished a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/dragon-fire-breath-orange.webp","_id":"s267b9ce0bfd18ab","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Aquatic Traits","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase one ability score of your Eidolon from among Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1.</p><p>Your Eidolon gains a Swim Speed if it doesn't already have one, equal to its highest Speed and it can breathe underwater.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/fish/fish-marlin-swordfight-blue.webp","_id":"s27cca51784c931d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fear Aura","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Any creature hostile to Eidolon that starts its turn within 20 feet of it or enters that area for the first time on a turn, must make a Wisdom Saving Throw against your spell save DC, unless the Eidolon is Incapacitated. On a failed save, the creature is Frightened until the start of its next turn. If a creature's Saving Throw is successful, the creature is Immune to the Eidolon's Fear Aura for the next 24 hours.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"any creature hostile to Eidolon that starts its turn within 20 feet of it or enters that area for the first time on a turn"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/spirit-fear-energy-pink.webp","_id":"s27d21eb03fa1e50","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Breath of the Sky","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Gust of Wind at-will, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s282684a2a1ba1e0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Path of the Seeker","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The Seeker bids you to travel in search of knowledge, and little can prevent you from walking this path. You ignore 3, have Advantage on all checks to Escape a Grapple, manacles, or rope bindings, and Advantage on Saving Throws against being Paralyzed.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"s285d3fc67657cd2","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Aquatic Odem","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 3 kinesis points to cast Water Breathing, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s2862f1fe883a71d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Impermeable","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to piercing damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s2897be7c20bef04","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Bait and Switch","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you're within 5 feet of a creature on your turn, you can expend one superiority die and switch places with that creature, provided you spend at least 5 feet of movement and the creature is willing and isn't Incapacitated. This movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p><p>Roll the superiority die. Until the start of your next turn, you or the other creature (your choice) gains a bonus to AC equal to the number rolled. This effect ends early if either of you become Incapaciated or you are more than 5 feet away from each other. The AC bonus from this maneuver does not stack with that from Evasive Footwork.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/svg/item-bag.svg","_id":"s2898f55afad563c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777213764583,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Draconic Scales","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You gain the benefits of Armor Mastery for Unarmored Defense and you have Resistance to the damage type associated with your draconic patron.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s28f36506e0e9ac5","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chain Master's Fury","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you command your familiar to attack, it makes one additional attack. Additionally, you add your Charisma modifier to your familiar's damage rolls.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s291763ddfd7fd35","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pact of the Star Chain","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A character dedicated to the Warlock can select this option instead of one of the warlock's existing Pact Boon options.</p><p>The Seeker grants you a chain forged from starlight, decorated with seven gleaming motes of brightness. While the chain is on your person, you know the Augury spell and can cast it as a ritual. The spell doesn't count against your number of spells known.</p><p>Additionally, you can invoke the Seeker's power to gain Advantage on an Intelligence check while you carry this item. Once you use this ability, you cannot use it again until you complete a Short or a Long Rest.</p><p>If you lose your Star Chain, you can perform a 1-hour ceremony to receive a replacement from the Seeker. The ceremony can be performed during a Short or a Long Rest, and it destroys the previous chain. The chain disappears in a flash of light when you die.</p><p>The exact form of this item might be different depending on your patron.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-silhouette.webp","_id":"s2b3634535a722cd","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Widen Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that has an area of effect, you can expend 2 sorcery points to double the area of effect in all dimensions.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s2baef17485a3ad7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pact of the Blade","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can use your Bonus Action to create a pact weapon in your empty hand. You can choose the form that this weapon takes each time you create it (see chapter 5 for weapon options). You are proficient with it while you wield it. This weapon counts as magical for the purpose of overcoming Resistance and Immunity to nonmagical attacks and damage.</p><p>Your pact weapon disappears if it is more than 5 feet away from you for 1 minute or more. It also disappears if you use this feature again, if you dismiss the weapon (no action required), or if you die.</p><p>You can transform one magic weapon into your pact weapon by performing a special ritual while you hold the weapon. You perform the ritual over the course of 1 hour, which can be done during a Short Rest. You can then dismiss the weapon, shunting it into an extradimensional space, and it appears whenever you create your pact weapon thereafter. You can't affect an artifact or a sentient weapon in this way. The weapon ceases being your pact weapon if you die, if you perform the 1-hour ritual on a different weapon, or if you use a 1-hour ritual to break your bond to it. The weapon appears at your feet if it is in the extradimensional space when the bond breaks.</p><p>You also gain Proficiency in medium armor and shields.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-teal.webp","_id":"s2c16a3543344236","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591063,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shroud of Ulban","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The blue-white star Ulban maintains a fickle presence among the stars, fluttering into view only to herald a dire omen. As an Action, you can turn Invisible for 1 minute. If you attack, deal damage, or force a creature to make a Saving Throw, you become visible at the end of the current turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s2d1bc197e83a731","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Raven Mother's Blessing","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you finish a Short Rest, you are automatically considered under the effect of the Death Ward spell, but the duration lasts until you finish your next Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/holy/barrier-shield-winged-cross.webp","_id":"s2edaf72fe6c4c4b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eldritch Mind","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Advantage on Constitution Saving Throws that you make to maintain your Concentration on a spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/unholy/strike-hand-glow-pink.webp","_id":"s2f45d3ae6d9b418","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Helm of Awareness","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing this helmet, a creature has Advantage on initiative rolls. In addition, the wearer can't be Surprised, provided it isn't Incapacitated.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s2f656e4f9e96130","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Precision","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your critical range with weapon attacks increases by 1. If you critically hit with a weapon, you deal additional damage equal to two rolls of your hemocraft die.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s2f8201ee05ff599","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Sweeping Cinder Strike","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 2 ki points to cast Burning Hands.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s3058d04f9a440db","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Spellbound Blade","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You learn one of the following Cantrips: Booming Blade, Green-Flame Blade, True Strike. Once per turn, when you make a weapon attack, you can replace it with one of these cantrips.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s31ec3be01c77e0e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Spell-Refueling Ring","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing this ring, the creature can recover one expended spell slot as an Action. The recovered slot can be of 3rd level or lower. Once used, the ring can't be used again until the next dawn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s32629b5673a0165","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Embrace of the Earth","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Stoneskin, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"s32881556cab85e8","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Black Blood","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>If a creature within 10 feet of you deals piercing or slashing to you, it takes acid damage equal to your two rolls of your hemocraft die and any healing it receives is halved until the end of its next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s32ecf735c1056e5","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Grappling Attacks","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Creatures no more than one size larger than your Eidolon that are hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks have to make a STR or DEX Saving Throw (target creature's choice) against your spell save DC. On failure, the target creature is Grappled by your Eidolon. Creatures that are the same size of the Eidolon or smaller, are also Restrained while Grappled in this manner.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"creatures no more than one size larger than your Eidolon that are hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"str","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/stinger-spine-horn-blood.webp","_id":"s35623a5fc8d799d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Minions of Chaos","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Conjure Elemental once. You can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s35d260567394a36","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Light","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing this armor, you have a number of temporary hitpoints equal to its AC, which stack with any other form of temporary hitpoints. You regain any lost temporary hitpoints from this feature when you finish a Short or a Long Rest by expending 1 sp per temporary hitpoint.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s381580b3b9bbc2d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Exorcist","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you choose one creature you can see within 30 feet of you that is Charmed or Frightened, or which is under a possession effect. The target creature is no longer Charmed, Frightened, or possessed.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> A creature that Charmed, Frightened, or possessed the target of your curse takes 3d6 psychic damage and must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or be Stunned until the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["3d6","psychic"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/fear-fright-monster-grin-red-orange.webp","_id":"s38b389012176347","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Toppling Attacks","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Creatures no more than one size larger than your Eidolon that are hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks have to make a STR Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On failure, the target creature is knocked Prone.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"creatures no more than one size larger than your Eidolon that are hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"str","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/ranged/projectile-strike-impale-gray.webp","_id":"s38f40466fcd0f86","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Arcane Propulsion Armor","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The wearer of this armor gains these benefits:</p><ul><li>The wearer's Speed increases by 5 feet.</li><li>The armor includes gauntlets, each of which is a magic melee weapon that can be wielded only when the hand is holding nothing. The wearer is proficient with the gauntlets, and each one deals 1d8 force damage on a hit and has the thrown property, with a normal range of 20 feet and a long range of 60 feet. When thrown, the gauntlet detaches and flies at the attack's target, then immediately returns to the wearer and reattaches.</li><li>The armor can't be removed against the wearer's will.</li><li>If the wearer is missing any limbs, the armor replaces those limbs—hands, arms, feet, legs, or similar appendages. The replacements function identically to the body parts they replace.</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"s3a2b3016b12f3d0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Repulsion Shield","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A creature gains a +1 bonus to Armor Class while wielding this shield. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p><p>The shield has 4 charges. While holding it, the wielder can use a Reaction immediately after being hit by a melee attack to expend 1 of the shield's charges and push the attacker up to 15 feet away. The shield regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"s3a302980e1afc4b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Regeneration","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon regenerates an amount of hitpoints equal to twice your Proficiency at the start of each of its turns.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/cross-explosion-burst-green.webp","_id":"s3a9ee4c9577a8c5","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Witch Sight","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Truesight with a range of 30 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp","_id":"s3ab1fb3081f1574","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Great Weapon Fighting","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you roll a 1 or 2 on a damage die for an attack you make with a melee weapon that you are wielding with two hands, you can reroll the die and must use the new roll, even if the new roll is a 1 or a 2. The weapon must have the two-handed or versatile property for you to gain this benefit.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-sword-steel-yellow.webp","_id":"s3da84db02342126","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chamaeleon Hide","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Dexterity or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon can use its Bonus Action to become Invisible. The invisibility ends if your Eidolon performs a hostile action.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/reptiles/chameleon-camouflage-green-brown.webp","_id":"s3ec461267558988","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Beguiling Influence","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You gain Proficiency in the Deception and Persuasion skills.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/control-influence-rally-purple.webp","_id":"s3fc094c5cafdab3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Moon Bow","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The damage die of your pact weapon increases by one size. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with your pact weapon, you can force it to make a Dexterity Saving Throw. The DC equals 8 + Proficiency + your spellcasting ability + the weapon's enhancement bonus. On a failed save, the target sheds dim light in a 10-feet radius and cannot benefit from invisibility until the start of your next turn. During that time, all Attack Rolls against the target have Advantage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s4077e0064d582ff","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Distant Kinesis","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use a kinetic shape, you can spend 1 kinesis point to double its range.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/targeting/target-strike-triple-blue.webp","_id":"s414724525cfd98b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591072,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Rush of the Gale Spirits","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 2 ki points to cast Gust of Wind.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s41e11f6025847f3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Enfeebling Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You weave necromantic magic into your projectile. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x your Proficiency extra necrotic damage. The target must also succeed on a Constitution Saving Throw, or the damage dealt by its weapon attacks is halved for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s421e111f36c5731","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Brace","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature you can see moves into the reach you have with the melee weapon you're wielding, you can use your Reaction to expend one superiority die and make one attack against the creature, using that weapon. If the attack hits, add the superiority die to the weapon's damage roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s434064b779d63d0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Superior Technique","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You learn one maneuver of your choice from among those available to the fighter archetype. If a maneuver you use requires your target to make a Saving Throw to resist the maneuver's effects, the Saving Throw DC equals 8 + your Proficiency bonus + your Strength or Dexterity modifier (your choice).</p><p>You gain one superiority die, which is a d6 (this die is added to any superiority dice you have from another source). This die is used to fuel your maneuvers. A superiority die is expended when you use it. You regain your expended superiority dice when you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p><p>When you reach level 10, the size of this die increases to a d8.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/sword-twirl-orange.webp","_id":"s4472fa7a894a2d8","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777213764582,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Celerity","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Dexterity score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. At 11th level in this class, both bonuses increase to 4. You can have only one Ability Score-increasing mutagen active on you at a time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s45449d99355c4f4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Subterranean Traits","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase one ability score of your Eidolon from among Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1.</p><p>Your Eidolon gains a Climb Speed equal to its Speed and a Burrow Speed equal to half its Speed.</p><p>Additionally, the darkvision range of your Eidolon increases to 120 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"s47d94235a15d699","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Mariner","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As long as you are not wearing heavy armor or using a shield, you have a Swim Speed and a Climb Speed equal to your normal Speed, and you gain a +1 bonus to AC.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/wave-water-blue.webp","_id":"s48479ecc1088203","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Earthen Grip","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Maximilian's Earthen Grasp at-will, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"s485d9530bc87a18","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Damage Immunity","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you are in Symbiosis with your Eidolon, you are Immune to every damage type you selected for Damage Resistance evolution feat.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-deflect-teal.webp","_id":"s488390a5163d538","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Flurry","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use two-weapon fighting and both of your weapons have this mastery, you can make the extra attack of your off-hand weapon as part of the Attack action rather than as a Bonus Action. If you do so, you can't use any other mastery with the attacks that are part of this Attack action.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-yellow-red.webp","_id":"s48e0c2bba700a40","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Flames of the Phoenix","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 ki points to cast Fireball.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s4915bb413ca5fe9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Draconic Spells","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you roll a 1 or 2 on a damage die for a spell you cast that deals damage of the type associated with your draconic patron, you can reroll the die. You must use the new roll, even if it is a 1 or 2.</p><p>Additionally, you can also replace any of the spells learned through your Mystic Arcana with a spell that deals damage of the type associated with your draconic patron and is of the same spell level as the spell replaced in this manner.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-light-fire-blue.webp","_id":"s4abbfe6e68a5ba3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Distant Arts","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell on your turn that has a range of 30 feet or greater, you can spend 1 Ki point to also give that same range to your Unarmed Attacks this turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s4d1a013530c59e0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chronicle of the Raven Mother","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can place a corpse's hand or similar appendage on your Book of Shadows and ask one question aloud. After 1 minute, the answer appears written in blood in your book. The answer is provided by the dead creature's spirit to the best of its knowledge and is translated into a language of your choice. You must use this ability within 1 minute of a creature's death, and a given creature can only be asked one question in this manner.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s4dc588e288537e3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ground Stomp","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Earth Tremor at-will, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s4e5ab1d727c965b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chilling Hex","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you apply your Hexblade's Curse to a creature, it and creatures within 5 feet of it also take cold damage equal to half your Warlock level + your Charisma modifier.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s4f4ae69c8538992","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Nighteye","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have darkvision out to a range of 60 feet. If you already have darkvision, its range increases by 60 feet. At 11th level in this class, you can see normally in complete darkness.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s4fd89cbc3decded","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Wall Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>By spending an Action and 3 kinesis points, you can use your kinetic shape to create a wall of churning elements, flensing debris, or roiling energy that lasts for 1 minute or until your Concentration ends (as if concentrating on a spell). You can make the wall up to 60 feet long, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or a ringed wall up to 20 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick.</p><p>When the wall appears, each creature within its area must make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failed save, a creature takes half your kinetic shape's damage, or half as much damage on a successful save.</p><p>A creature takes the same damage when it enters the wall for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s503d8e7e8d6af11","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Spindle Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>By spending an Action and 1 kinesis point, you can cause the energy of your kinetic shape to shootward in a 10-feet long, 5-feet wide spindle that travels 60 feet away from you until it disperses.</p><p>All creatures through whose spaces the spindle passes have to make a Dexterity Saving Throw, taking your kinetic shape damage on failure, and half as much on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s50656338a563b2f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Lacerating Attacks","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Dexterity by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Creatures hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks have to make a CON Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On failure, the target creature is Lacerated. At the end of each of its turns, the creature can repeat the Saving Throw, ending the condition on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"creatures hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/wounds/injury-triple-slash-bleed.webp","_id":"s513e06f0edbf80f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Mist Stance","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 ki points to cast Gaseous Form, targeting yourself.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s51a0964ba253b44","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Hardened Hide","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon's AC increases by 2.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/armor-stone-skin.webp","_id":"s5251930784a5c54","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Maneuvering Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to maneuver one of your comrades into a more advantageous position. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and you choose a friendly creature who can see or hear you. That creature can use its Reaction to move up to half its Speed without provoking Opportunity Attacks from the target of your attack.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s52962f751b9b8d1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Howl","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you unleash a bloodcurdling howl. Each creature within 30 feet of you that can hear you must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or have Disadvantage on Attack Rolls and Ability Checks until the end of your next turn. You can choose any number of creatures you can see to be unaffected by the howl.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The range of this curse increases to 60 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":30,"width":null,"units":"ft","type":"sphere"},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":"self"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["3d6","psychic"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"wis","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/dragon-breath-purple.webp","_id":"s5354355c8116207","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of Corrosion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you deal acid damage equal to three rolls of your hemocraft die to a creature you can see within 30 feet of you. The target then has to make a Constitution Saving Throw. On a failure, attack rolls against the target have Advantage until the end of your next turn. On a success, only the first attack roll has Advantage.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> Every time the target takes damage while under this curse's effect, it takes additional acid damage equal to one roll of your hemocraft die.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["2 * @attributes.prof","acid"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/acid/dissolve-arm-flesh.webp","_id":"s536f076f526c575","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Petrifying Gaze","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As an Action, your Eidolon can gaze at a creature within 60 feet of it, causing it to gradually turn to stone. The target creature has to make a CON Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On a failed save, it is Restrained as its flesh begins to harden. On a successful save, the creature isn't affected.</p><p>A creature restrained by this ability must make another Constitution Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves against this ability three times, the effect ends. If it fails its saves three times, it is turned to stone and subjected to the Petrified condition for the duration. The successes and failures don't need to be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.</p><p>If the creature is physically broken while petrified, it suffers from similar deformities if it reverts to its original state.</p><p>Once it has used its petrifying gaze it cannot do so again until you finish a Short Rest or you spend a spell slot of 5th level or higher.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":10,"units":"minute"},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":60,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":1,"max":1,"per":"sr","recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":1},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/eyes/humanoid-single-blind.webp","_id":"s53a61a2ec0a21e9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gelid","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to cold damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s54c4ac0ae175140","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Bewitching Whispers","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Compulsion once. You can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s551ff9cdd085e3d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blessed Warrior","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You learn two cantrips of your choice from the cleric spell list. They count as paladin spells for you, and Charisma is your spellcasting ability for them. Whenever you gain a level in this class, you can replace one of these cantrips with another cantrip from the cleric spell list.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/weapons/swords/sword-gold-holy.webp","_id":"s5545190362aea09","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Hand of Ore","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 2 ki points to cast Maximilian's Earthen Grasp.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s5732566083d951b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eruption","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>By spending an Action and 2 kinesis points, you can cause the energy of your kinetic shape to explode outward in a 10-foot radius cylinder that is 40 feet high.</p><p>Every creature in the area of effect has to make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your save DC, taking your kinetic shape damage on a failure, and half as much on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s58523f1299a6fa3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Enhanced Physiology","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase one ability score of your Eidolon from among Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 2 or increase 2 ability scores from among those by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>This evolution feat can be selected multiple times.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/construct-iron-stomping-yellow.webp","_id":"s59012cc9cc5c0aa","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chilling Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you damage a creature with your kinetic blast, you can force it to make a Constitution Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failure, the creature's next Attack Roll before the end of its next turn is made with Disadvantage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s59433ac60d21484","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Armor of Shadows","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Mage Armor on yourself at will, without expending a spell slot or material components.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"s59ece74134d438d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Feinting Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you make a melee weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to perform a feint. The target of the attack has to make a Wisdom Saving Throw. On a failure, you have Advantage on this attack roll against the target and you add your superiority die to the damage if the attack hits.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s5a2829762217a70","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eternal Mountain Defense","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 5 ki points to cast Stoneskin, targeting yourself.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"s5acc81cc6043bdc","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Legendary Resistance","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When your Eidolon fails a Saving Throw, it can choose to succeed instead.</p><p>Your Eidolon can use this feature three times and it regains all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":1,"condition":"when your Eidolon fails a Saving Throw"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":3,"max":3,"per":"lr","recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":1},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/barrier-shield-dome-deflect-teal.webp","_id":"s5d6348adcfae91d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Frost Rune","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This rune's magic evokes the might of those who survive in the wintry wilderness, such as frost giants. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with this rune, you have Advantage on Wisdom (Animal Handling) checks and Charisma (Intimidation) checks.</p><p>In addition, you can invoke the rune as a Bonus Action to increase your sturdiness. For 10 minutes, you gain a +2 bonus to all Ability Checks and Saving Throws that use Strength or Constitution. Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s5dd1f63830af8f2","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Thirsting Blade","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can attack with your pact weapon twice, instead of once, whenever you take the Attack action on your turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s5e4561f44e4d7f9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eldritch Sight","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Detect Magic at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp","_id":"s5e6518dbf835d97","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Adder's Kiss","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you damage a creature with a weapon attack, you can afflict them with a magical venom. At the start of each of its turns, the affected creature takes poison damage equal to 2 x your Proficiency. At the end of each of its turns, the target makes a Constitution Saving Throw. If the target suffers from the Poisoned condition, it makes this save with Disadvantage.</p><p>If it succeeds on the save three times, the venom's effect on it ends. Every time it fails the save - up until including the third time - the poison damage increases by 2 x your Proficiency. After the third failed save the poison lasts for 1 hour.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The target cannot benefit from any healing while affected by the poison.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-yellow-red.webp","_id":"s6052132f57fa10e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Vanguard","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Whenever you a creature summoned by you that is within 20 feet of your Eidolon must make a Saving Throw, the creature gains a bonus to the Saving Throw equal to your choice of your Intelligence or Charisma modifier (with a minimum bonus of +1).</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-aura-energy.webp","_id":"s61b48186684db74","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591059,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eidolon Resilience","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose one ability score. Your Eidolon gains the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase the chosen ability score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>Your Eidolon gains Proficiency in Saving Throws using the chosen ability.</li></ul><p>This evolution feat can be selected multiple times.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/humanoid-silhouette-green.webp","_id":"s623d101a630c53d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Sap","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can force it to make a CON Saving Throw. On a failure, it must roll a d4 when it next makes an Attack Roll or Saving Throw (your choice) and subtract the result from the total.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s6636baceb11ea41","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Book of Ancient Secrets","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can now inscribe magical rituals in your Book of Shadows. Choose two 1st-level spells that have the ritual tag from any class's spell list. The spells needn't be from the same spell list. The spells appear in the book and don't count against the number of spells you know. With your Book of Shadows in hand, you can cast the chosen spells as rituals. You can't cast the spells except as rituals, unless you've learned them by some other means. You can also cast a warlock spell you know as a ritual if it has the ritual tag.</p><p>On your adventures, you can add other ritual spells to your Book of Shadows. When you find such a spell, you can add it to the book if the spell's level is equal to or less than half your warlock level (rounded up) and if you can spare the time to transcribe the spell. For each level of the spell, the transcription process takes 2 hours and costs 50 gp for the rare inks needed to inscribe it.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s667f14575a5aff1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Wreath of Flames","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Fire Shield (warm shield), but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s66a6b356325beb5","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pierce","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can roll a d4 and add it to the next weapon attack roll you make against the target before the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s675fef2b2d7f031","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Storm Rune","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Using this rune, you can glimpse the future like a storm giant seer. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with this rune, you have Advantage on Intelligence (Arcana) checks, and you can't be Surprised as long as you aren't Incapacitated.</p><p>In addition, you can invoke the rune as a Bonus Action to enter a prophetic state for 1 minute or until you're Incapacitated. Until the state ends, when you or another creature you can see within 60 feet of you makes an Attack Roll, a Saving Throw, or an Ability Check, you can use your Reaction to cause the roll to have Advantage or Disadvantage. Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s6765373e499131d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ambush","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you make a Dexterity (Stealth) check or an initiative roll, you can expend one superiority die and add the die to the roll, provided you aren't Incapacitated.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s67d438f6c23009b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Infirm","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you weaken the health of a creature within 30 feet of you. Until the start of your next turn, whenever the target takes poison or necrotic damage, it takes additional damage of the same type equal to a roll of your hemocraft die.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The next Constitution Saving Throw the cursed creature makes before this curse ends has Disadvantage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/heart-broken-red.webp","_id":"s6a01b4bceb309ba","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blazing Agony","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 5 kinesis points to cast Immolation, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s6a43bedda1aedb1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Far Scribe","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A new page appears in your Book of Shadows. With your permission, a creature can use its action to write its name on that page, which can contain a number of names equal to your Proficiency bonus.</p><p>You can cast the Sending spell, targeting a creature whose name is on the page, without using a spell slot and without using material components. To do so, you must write the message on the page. The target hears the message in their mind, and if the target replies, their message appears on the page, rather than in your mind. The writing disappears after 1 minute.</p><p>As an Action, you can magically erase a name on the page by touching it.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s6b83e8dd56e8695","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Aether","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have a Fly Speed equal to your Speed for 1 hour and you can hover.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s6c114fd0a72dee0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Sign of Ill Omen","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Bestow Curse once. You can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s6d596d3b7c9a630","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Cleave","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can also deal damage equal to your STR or DEX (your choice) to any other creature that is within range of your attack and within 5 ft of the original target, provided that your Attack Roll would've also hit these targets. This damage is doubled if the Attack Roll was a critical hit.</p><p>If the attack reduced the original target to 0 hitpoints, you add the excess damage to cleave's effect on one of the additional targets.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s6d5bbfe49681ffc","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Dimensional Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You target an unoccupied space within 20 x your Proficiency ft that you can see instead of a creature. You shoot the projectile at the location and then teleport towards it. Any effect that prevents the projectile from reaching its destination also cuts short your teleport. In such a case you instead teleport to where the projectile was stopped or to the nearest unoccupied space of your choice.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/movement/portal-vortex-orange.webp","_id":"s6e1636f0be269f7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Distant Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that has a range of 5 feet or greater, you can spend 1 sorcery point to double the range of the spell.</p><p>When you cast a spell that has a range of touch, you can spend 1 sorcery point to make the range of the spell 30 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/targeting/target-strike-triple-blue.webp","_id":"s6e22d33218f44af","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Draconic Wings","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You grow a pair of dragon wings and gain a Fly Speed equal to your Speed. Any armor and clothing you want to don must accomodate them.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s6e76ea668627b66","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Muddled Mind","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you curse a creature that you can see within 30 feet of you that is concentrating on a spell or using a feature that requires Concentration. The target has to make a Charisma Saving Throw. On a failure, the affected creature has Disadvantage on Wisdom, Intelligence, and Concentration Saving Throws until the start of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> This curse lasts for 1 minute. The cursed creature can make a Charisma Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself at the start of your next turn on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"cha","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-swirl.webp","_id":"s6e8124d7141396d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Undying Servitude","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Animate Dead without using a spell slot. Once you do so, you can't cast it in this way again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s6f1a3ea33199065","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Green Lord's Gift","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The Green Lord oversees a verdant realm of everlasting summer. Your soul is linked to his power. Whenever you regain hit points, you treat any dice rolled to determine the hit points you regain as having rolled their maximum value.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/heart-glowing-red.webp","_id":"s6fa4b712321d784","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Two-Weapon Fighting","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you engage in two-weapon fighting, you can add your ability modifier to the damage of the second attack.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"s6faffec38eae402","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Breath of Winter","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 6 ki points to cast Cone of Cold.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s6fcbc09bf6823f4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Interception","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature you can see hits a target, other than you, within 5 feet of you with an attack, you can use your Reaction to reduce the damage the target takes by 1d10 + your Proficiency bonus (to a minimum of 0 damage). You must be wielding a shield or a simple or martial weapon to use this Reaction.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when a creature you can see hits a target, other than you, within 5 feet of you with an attack"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"1d10 + @attributes.prof","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/swords-parry-block-yellow.webp","_id":"s7099d18e6f372dd","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chains of Carceri","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Hold Monster at will—targeting a celestial, fiend, or elemental—without expending a spell slot or material components. You must finish a Long Rest before you can use this invocation on the same creature again.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s70ddd4200fc31e9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Unshakeable Devotion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon is Immune to the Charmed and Frightened conditions.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/mammals/beast-horned-scaled-glowing-orange.webp","_id":"s7238be5e865102e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Relentless Hex","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your curse creates a temporary bond between you and your target. As a Bonus Action, you can magically teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see within 5 feet of the target cursed by your Hex spell or by a warlock feature of yours, such as Hexblade's Curse or Sign of Ill Omen. To teleport in this way, you must be able to see the cursed target.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s7291024c4b51a71","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Command the Heavens","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 8 kinesis points to cast Control Weather, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/flags/banner-sword-blue.webp","_id":"s734fe5816240f68","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eldritch Smite","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with your pact weapon, you can expend a warlock spell slot to deal an extra 1d8 force damage to the target, plus another 1d8 per level of the spell slot, and you can force the target to make a Strength saving throw or fall Prone. The DC equals 8 + Proficiency + your spellcasting ability + the weapon's enhancement bonus.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/unholy/strike-hand-glow-pink.webp","_id":"s736000b06195c4e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Evasive Footwork","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend one Superiority Die and take the Disengage action. You also roll the die and add the number rolled to your AC until the start of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s73a387fbf2faded","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Riposte","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature misses you with a melee attack, you can use your Reaction and expend one superiority die to make a melee weapon attack against the creature. If you hit, you add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s73ac288334d9898","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fire Rune","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This rune's magic channels the masterful craftsmanship of great smiths. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with this rune, your Proficiency bonus is doubled for any Ability Check you make that uses your Proficiency with a tool.</p><p>In addition, when you hit a creature with an attack using a weapon, you can invoke the rune to summon fiery shackles: the target takes an extra 2d6 fire damage, and it must succeed on a Strength Saving Throw or be Restrained for 1 minute. While Restrained by the shackles, the target takes 2d6 fire damage at the start of each of its turns. The target can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, banishing the shackles on a success. Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s73df988aacf0bbf","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Imprisoning Rock","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 6 kinesis points to cast Flesh to Stone, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s75083f6ebd01e46","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fiendish Vigor","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast False Life on yourself without expending a spell slot. When you cast the spell with this feature, you don't roll the die for the Temporary Hit Points; you automatically get the highest number on the die.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s766a40995e2aa2d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Careful Kinesis","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use your kinetic shape with an infusion that forces other creatures to make a Saving Throw, you can protect some of those creatures from the shape's full force. To do so, you spend 1 kinesis point and choose a number of those creatures up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one creature). A chosen creature automatically succeeds on its Saving Throws against the blast and takes no damage if it would normally take half damage on a successful save.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/nature/beam-hand-leaves-green.webp","_id":"s7821f453c5ad70f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591072,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Devil's Sight","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can see normally in darkness and dim light, both magical and nonmagical, to a distance of 120 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp","_id":"s786b661fa1fcb7e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Radiant Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This magic weapon grants a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p><p>While holding it, the wielder can take a Bonus Action to cause it to shed bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. The wielder can extinguish the light as a Bonus Action.</p><p>The weapon has 4 charges. As a Reaction immediately after being hit by an attack, the wielder can expend 1 charge and cause the attacker to be Blinded until the end of the attacker's next turn, unless the attacker succeeds on a Constitution Saving Throw against your spell save DC. The weapon regains 1d4 expended charges daily at dawn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"s788481057369be9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Kiss of Mephistopheles","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with your Eldritch Blast, you can cast Fireball as a Bonus Action using a warlock spell slot. The spell must be centered on the creature you hit with Eldritch Blast.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-yellow-red.webp","_id":"s79bd4d38129f6a1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Resistant Armor","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing this armor, a creature has Resistance to one of the following damage types, which you choose when you infuse the item: acid, cold, fire, force, lightning, necrotic, poison, psychic, radiant, or thunder.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"s7b231161b33c536","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Unbreakable","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to bludgeoning damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s7cdb0095e11c1ef","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Quickened Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that has a casting time of an Action, you can spend 2 Sorcery Points to change the casting time to a Bonus Action for this casting. You can't modify a spell in this way if you've already cast a level 1+ spell on the current turn, nor can you cast a level 1+ spell on this turn after modifying a spell in this way.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell that has a casting time of an Action"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/time/clock-stopwatch-white-blue.webp","_id":"s7d074bc3582eef7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Entangling Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you damage a creature with your kinetic shape, you can spend 1 kinesis point to force it to make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failure, the creature is Restrained for 1 minute.</p><p>At the end of each of its turns, the creature can make a Strength Saving Throw, ending the effect on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s7da3c70995e7366","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Stone Rune","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This rune's magic channels the judiciousness associated with stone giants. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with this rune, you have Advantage on Wisdom (Insight) checks, and you have darkvision out to a range of 120 feet.</p><p>In addition, when a creature you can see ends its turn within 30 feet of you, you can use your Reaction to invoke the rune and force the creature to make a Wisdom Saving Throw. Unless the save succeeds, the creature is Charmed by you for 1 minute. While Charmed in this way, the creature has a Speed of 0 and is Incapacitated, descending into a dreamy stupor. The creature repeats the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success. Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s7dea4509a2c6333","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Maximized Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you roll damage for a spell, you can spend 2 sorcery points and choose a number damage dice up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). You maximize the rolled result for the chosen dice.</p><p>You can use Maximized Spell even if you have already used a different Metamagic option during the casting of the spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you roll damage for a spells"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/fire/orb-vortex.webp","_id":"s7e19261811082ea","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Empowered Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you roll damage for a spell, you can spend 1 sorcery point to reroll a number of the damage dice up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). You must use the new rolls.</p><p>You can use Empowered Spell even if you have already used a different Metamagic option during the casting of the spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you roll damage for a spell"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/air/wind-tornado-wall-blue.webp","_id":"s7e20eacd3d0940a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gift of the Protectors","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A new page appears in your Book of Shadows. With your permission, a creature can use its action to write its name on that page, which can contain a number of names equal to your Proficiency bonus.</p><p>When any creature whose name is on the page is reduced to 0 hit points but not killed outright, the creature magically drops to 1 hit point instead. Once this magic is triggered, no creature can benefit from it until you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>As an Action, you can magically erase a name on the page by touching it.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"s7e431300d2241a8","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Grasping Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When this projectile strikes its target, transmutation magic turns it into grasping, poisonous brambles, which wrap around the target. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x your Proficiency extra poison damage, its Speed is reduced by 10 feet, and it takes D6 x your Proficiency slashing damage the first time on each turn it moves 1 foot or more without teleporting. The target or any creature that can reach it can use its action to remove the brambles with a successful Strength (Athletics) check against your Arcane Shot save DC. Otherwise, the brambles last for 1 minute or until you use this option again.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s7f5e74c5d4912f7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Careful Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that forces other creatures to make a Saving Throw, you can protect some of those creatures from the spell's full force. To do so, you spend 1 sorcery point and choose a number of those creatures up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one creature). The chosen creatures automatically succeed on their Saving Throws against the spell, and they take no damage if they would normally take half damage on a successful save.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell that forces other creatures to make a Saving Throw"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/nature/beam-hand-leaves-green.webp","_id":"s80b07afadbab652","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Burning Hex","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you apply your Hexblade's Curse to a creature, it also takes fire damage equal to your Warlock level + your Charisma modifier.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s80c939852a96e20","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Wind Shaper","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Control Winds, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-hold-change-blue.webp","_id":"s810bc964c6b1776","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Breath Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon learns to exhale destructive energy. Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, poison, radiant, or thunder.</p><p>Additionally, choose the area shape that the Breath Weapon affects: 15 + 5 x Proficiency feet cone or 30 + 10 x Proficiency feet long, 5 feet wide line.</p><p>Your Eidolon can activate its Breath Weapon as an Action. Each creature in the area of effect has to make a DEX Saving Throw against your spell save DC, taking 4d6 + 1d6 x Proficiency of the chosen damage type on a failure and half as much on a success.</p><p>Once it has used its breath weapon it cannot do so again until you finish a Short Rest or you spend a spell slot of 3rd level or higher.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"action","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":1,"max":1,"per":"sr","recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":1},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["(4+floor(((@details.level)-1)/5))d6",""]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/fire/beam-jet-stream-trails-orange.webp","_id":"s819780f042aadb5","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gong of the Summit","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 3 ki points to cast Shatter.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s821a973b62b8a5d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Enhanced Defense","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>A creature gains a +1 bonus to Armor Class while wearing (armor) or wielding (shield) the infused item.</p><p>The bonus increases to +2 when you reach 10th level in this class. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"s835b1f062745d52","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eidolon Toughness","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon's hitpoints increase by an amount equal to twice your summoner level.</p><p>This evolution feat can be selected multiple times.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/spirit-undead-ghost-blue.webp","_id":"s8461dd639f510f7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591056,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eyes of the Rune Keeper","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can read all writing.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s848a790f2001bb0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shimmering Hide","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Eidolon projects a magical illusion that blurs its appearance to the naked eye and makes it difficult to tell its actual position and movements, causing Attack Rolls against it to have Disadvantage. If it takes damage, this trait is disrupted until the start of its next turn. This trait is also disrupted while the Eidolon is Incapacitated or has a Speed of 0.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/illusion-evasion-echo-purple.webp","_id":"s84aff8cf3908f7f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gift of the Ever-Living Ones","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Whenever you regain hit points while your familiar is within 100 feet of you, treat any dice rolled to determine the hit points you regain as having rolled their maximum value for you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/heart-glowing-red.webp","_id":"s84ed12579f3eab2","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Call the Flood","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 8 kinesis points to cast Tsunami, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s86a863fc19e38a7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Bond of the Talisman","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While someone else is wearing your talisman, you can use your action to teleport to the unoccupied space closest to them, provided the two of you are on the same plane of existence. The wearer of your talisman can do the same thing, using their action to teleport to you. The teleportation can be used a number of times equal to your Proficiency bonus, and all expended uses are restored when you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/trades/academics-investigation-puzzles.webp","_id":"s87e869e5fb03fdb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
