{"name":"Dreadful Word","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Confusion once. You can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s8945f4a315a392a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Bursting Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You imbue your projectile with force energy drawn from the school of evocation. The energy detonates after your attack. Immediately after the projectile hits the creature, The target and all other creatures within 10 feet of it take D6 x your Proficiency force damage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s8964d70ef51a6cd","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Caiphon's Beacon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The purple star Caiphon is the doom of inexperienced mariners. Those who use its deceptive light to guide their travels invariably come to ruin. You gain Proficiency in the Deception and Stealth skills, and you have Advantage on Attack Rolls against Charmed creatures.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s8975b4614799ccb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Mobility","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Immunity to the Grappled and Restrained conditions. At 11th level, you are also Immune to the Paralyzed condition.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s8c3f09ab68e5e9c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Thief of Five Fates","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Bane once. You can't do so again until you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s8cd80b266bf4efc","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Evasion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Dexterity by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p>If the Eidolon is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity Saving Throw to take only half damage, it instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the Saving Throw, and only half damage if it fails.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/light/beam-red-orange.webp","_id":"s8d0d887bd9c9a1a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Lunging Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend one Superiority Die and take the Dash action. If you move at least 5 feet in a straight line immediately before hitting with a melee attack as part of the Attack action on this turn, you can add the Superiority Die to the attack's damage roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s8d78d319fec6aff","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shape the Flowing River","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As an Action, you can spend 1 ki point to choose an area of ice or water no larger than 30 feet on a side within 120 feet of you. You can change water to ice within the area and vice versa, and you can reshape ice in the area in any manner you choose. You can raise or lower the ice's elevation, create or fill in a trench, erect or flatten a wall, or form a pillar. The extent of any such changes can't exceed half the area's largest dimension. For example, if you affect a 30-foot square, you can create a pillar up to 15 feet high. raise or lower the square's elevation by up to 15 feet, dig a trench up to 15 feet deep, and so on. You can't shape the ice to trap or injure a creature in the area.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-hold-change-blue.webp","_id":"s8d993344238d729","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Heavy","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing this armor, you have a number of temporary hitpoints equal to 1.5 times its AC (rounded down), which stack with any other form of temporary hitpoints. You regain any lost temporary hitpoints from this feature when you finish a Short or a Long Rest by expending 1 gp per temporary hitpoint.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s8e42b7d71570ece","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pushing Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to drive the target back. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and if the target is Large or smaller, it must make a Strength Saving Throw. On a failed save, you push the target up to 15 feet away from you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s8f798ab8b6a552f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Heightened Kinesis","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use your kinetic shape with an infusion that forces a creature to make a Saving Throw to resist its effects, you can spend 2 kinesis points to give one target of the shape Disadvantage on all its Saving Throws made against the effect.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/fire/explosion-mushroom-nuke-orange.webp","_id":"s900a8b580e8bb58","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shadow Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You weave illusion magic into your projectile, causing it to occlude your foe's vision with shadows. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x your Proficiency extra psychic damage, and it must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw or be unable to see anything farther than 5 feet away for 1 minute. The target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/silhouette-stealth-shadow.webp","_id":"s905b898ac7c62f4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Intertwined Metabolism","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you are in Symbiosis with your Eidolon, you are Immune to the Poisoned and Lacerated conditions and to non-magical diseases. If you enter Symbiosis while any of the aforementioned are already affecting either you or your Eidolon or both, they are removed at the end of the same turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/sihouette-hold-beam-green.webp","_id":"s90af8ca74041abc","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Otherworldly Leap","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Jump on yourself at will, without expending a spell slot or material components.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s911723fc1699263","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Unbroken Air","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can create a blast of compressed air that strikes like a mighty fist. As an Action, you can spend 2 ki points and choose a creature within 30 feet of you. That creature must make a Strength Saving Throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d10 bludgeoning damage, plus an extra 1d10 bludgeoning damage for each additional ki point you spend, and you can push the creature up to 20 feet away from you and knock it Prone. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage, and you don't push it or knock it Prone.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/air/wind-tornado-wall-blue.webp","_id":"s9224bf158e282ca","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Returning Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This magic weapon grants a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it, and it returns to the wielder's hand immediately after it is used to make a ranged attack. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"s92355efe8f278ff","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Embers","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to fire damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s928772519786d54","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Wave of Rolling Earth","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 6 ki points to cast Wall of Stone.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"s92db3b4fd9802ca","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Seeker's Speech","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your quest for knowledge allows you to master any spoken language. When you complete a Long Rest, you can pick two languages. You gain the ability to speak, read, and write the chosen languages until you finish your next Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"s92f265cf191ca74","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Repeating Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This magic weapon grants a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it when it's used to make a ranged attack, and it ignores the loading property if it has it. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p><p>If the weapon lacks ammunition, it produces its own, automatically creating one piece of magic ammunition when the wielder makes a ranged attack with it. The ammunition created by the weapon vanishes the instant after it hits or misses a target.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s946ed06337b0184","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Agonizing Blast","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that deals damage. You can add your Charisma modifier to that spell's damage rolls.</p><p><strong>Repeatable.</strong> You can gain this invocation more than once. Each time you do so, choose a different eligible cantrip.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s9518840c07cb944","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Master of Myriad Forms","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Alter Self at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-hold-change-blue.webp","_id":"s95325cef70e26e2","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Swift Arts","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use your Flurry of Blows, you can spend 2 Ki points to cast one of your Sorcerer cantrips that has a cast time of an Action in place of one of the attacks.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s96004ad089dc985","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Lance of Lethargy","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once on each of your turns when you hit a creature with a Warlock cantrip, you can reduce that creature's Speed by 10 feet until the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s9743c7457d57fe0","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Heightened Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that forces a creature to make a Saving Throw to resist its effects, you can spend 2 sorcery points to give one target of the spell Disadvantage on all its Saving Throws made against the spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell that forces a creature to make a Saving Throw to resist its effects"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/fire/explosion-mushroom-nuke-orange.webp","_id":"s974e8c0f485927d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Replicate Magic Item","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Using this infusion, you replicate a particular magic item. You can learn this infusion multiple times; each time you do so, choose a magic item that you can make with it, picking from the Replicable Items tables below. A table's title tells you the level you must be in the class to choose an item from the table. Alternatively, you can choose the magic item from among the common magic items in the game, not including potions or scrolls.</p><p>In the tables, an item's entry tells you whether the item requires attunement. See the item's description in the Dungeon Master's Guide for more information about it, including the type of object required for its making.</p><div style=\"width: 100%;\"><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><caption>Replicable Items (2nd-Level Artificer)</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Magic Item</th><th scope=\"col\">Attunement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Alchemy jug</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Bag of holding</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Cap of water breathing</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Goggles of night</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Rope of climbing</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Sending stones</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Wand of magic detection</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Wand of secrets</td><td>No</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"width: 100%;\"><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><caption>Replicable Items (6th-Level Artificer)</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Magic Item</th><th scope=\"col\">Attunement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Boots of elvenkind</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Cloak of elvenkind</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Cloak of the manta ray</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes of charming</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Gloves of thievery</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Lantern of revealing</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Pipes of haunting</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Ring of water walking</td><td>No</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"width: 100%;\"><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><caption>Replicable Items (10th-Level Artificer)</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Magic Item</th><th scope=\"col\">Attunement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Boots of striding and springing</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Boots of the winterlands</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Bracers of archery</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Brooch of shielding</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Cloak of protection</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes of the eagle</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Gauntlets of ogre power</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Gloves of missile snaring</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Gloves of swimming and climbing</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Hat of disguise</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Headband of intellect</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Helm of telepathy</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Medallion of thoughts</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Necklace of adaptation</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Periapt of wound closure</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Pipes of the sewers</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Quiver of Ehlonna</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Ring of jumping</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Ring of mind shielding</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Slippers of spider climbing</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Ventilating lungs (detailed in 13)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Winged boots</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"width: 100%;\"><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><caption>Replicable Items (14th-Level Artificer)</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Magic Item</th><th scope=\"col\">Attunement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Amulet of health</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Arcane propulsion arm (detailed in 13)</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Belt of hill giant strength</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Boots of levitation</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Boots of speed</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Bracers of defense</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Cloak of the bat</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Dimensional shackles</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Gem of seeing</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Horn of blasting</td><td>No</td></tr><tr><td>Ring of free action</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Ring of protection</td><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><td>Ring of the ram</td><td>Yes</td></tr></tbody></table></div>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s975f9e40376c361","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Archery","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You gain a +2 bonus to Attack Rolls you make with ranged weapons.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/weapons/bows/shortbow-recurve-yellow.webp","_id":"s97d499ca60a9d58","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Improved Speed","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon's Speed increases by 10 feet.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/humanoid-silhouette-dashing-blue.webp","_id":"s97f47d97b343017","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Twinned Kinesis","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use your kinetic shape with an infusion that doesn't have a range of self and is incapable of targeting more than one creature, you can spend 3 kinesis points to have it target a second creature within range as well.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/lightning/bolt-strike-blue.webp","_id":"s98afeb6214df79d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Hill Rune","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This rune's magic bestows a resilience reminiscent of a hill giant. While wearing or carrying an object that bears this rune, you have Advantage on Saving Throws against being Poisoned, and you have Resistance against poison damage.</p><p>In addition, you can invoke the rune as a Bonus Action, gaining Resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage for 1 minute. Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"s99ae3b7bcba227c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Magic Resistance (EF)","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The Eidolon has Advantage on Saving Throws against spells and other magical effects.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/barrier-shield-dome-blue-purple.webp","_id":"s99b630c606076e8","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Grappling Strike","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to grapple the target. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, it must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed save, the target becomes Grappled by you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s9a89674b63b8a1a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Enhanced Arcane Focus","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While holding this item, a creature gains a +1 bonus to spell Attack Rolls and to its Spell Save DC.</p><p>The bonus increases to +2 when you reach 10th level in this class. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s9b559d4daad063e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Twinned Arts","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell that targets only one creature and doesn't have a range of self, you can spend a number of Ki points equal to the spell's level to target a second creature in range with the same spell (1 Ki point if the spell is a cantrip). You can spend up to 4 additional Ki points. For each additiona Ki point expended, one of your Unarmed Attacks this turn can target a second creature within their reach, using the original attack and damage roll.</p><p>To be eligible, a spell must be incapable of targeting more than one creature at the spell's current level. For example, Magic Missile and Scorching Ray aren't eligible, but Ray of Frost and Chromatic Orb are.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s9b80ce5074e4893","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Improved Skill","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon learns one additional skill. If it is already proficient in the skill, it adds double your Proficiency bonus to checks it makes with it.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/social/diplomacy-peace-alliance.webp","_id":"s9c1e6fd65da17ac","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Earthed","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to lightning damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"s9cf5dc9f6c06552","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Earth Shaper","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Move Earth, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"s9d8aa503e93ead1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Walk on Water","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Water Walk at-will, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/water-hand.webp","_id":"s9da61717abb1888","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Voice of the Chain Master","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can communicate telepathically with your familiar and perceive through your familiar's senses as long as you are on the same plane of existence. Additionally, while perceiving through your familiar's senses, you can also speak through your familiar in your own voice, even if your familiar is normally incapable of speech.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/projectile-ice-teardrop.webp","_id":"s9ea44d84820d964","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gift of the Depths","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can breathe underwater, and you gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed.</p><p>You can also cast Water Breathing once without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to do so when you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"s9f3ef5496a4065b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Precision Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you miss with an Attack Roll, you can expend one Superiority Die, roll that die, and add it to the Attack Roll, potentially causing the attack to hit.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"s9f5b330e4296904","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Fallen Puppet","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you drops to 0 hit points, you can use your Reaction to instill that creature with a final act of aggression. The creature immediately makes one weapon attack against a target of your choice within its range.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> You can first cause the cursed creature to move up to half its Speed, and you grant a bonus to its Attack Roll equal to your Hemocraft modifier (minimum of +1).</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when a creature you can see within 30 feet of you drops to 0 hit points"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"max(1, @abilities.int.mod, @abilities.wis.mod)","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/control-influence-puppet.webp","_id":"sa3c82d0b13495ca","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Surgical Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This magic weapon grants a +2 bonus to damage rolls and skill checks to harvest ingredients from monsters made with it.</p><p>The bonus increases to +4 when you reach 10th level in this class. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"sa5d6da16203dc6f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Close Quarters Shooter","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When making a ranged weapon attack while you are within 5 feet of a hostile creature, you do not have Disadvantage on the Attack Roll. Your ranged weapon attacks ignore half cover and three-quarters cover against targets within 30 feet of you. You have a +1 bonus to Attack Rolls on ranged weapon attacks.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/ranged/person-archery-bow-attack-orange.webp","_id":"sa7280b93ed079ef","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Dueling","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you are wielding a melee weapon in one hand and no other weapons, you gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls with that weapon.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/hand-grip-sword-orange.webp","_id":"sa88d8e0b7cefb10","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blinding Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with your kinetic shape, you can spend 1 kinesis point to force it to make a Constitution Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failure, the creature is Blinded for 1 minute.</p><p>At the end of each of its turns, the creature can repeat the Saving Throw, ending the effect on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"saa1bf5289f3014f","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pounce","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Dexterity by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Once per turn, as part of a melee weapon attack, your Eidolon can move up to its Speed in a straight line towards a target of your choice.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/cougar-pounce-stalk-black.webp","_id":"sab3735b18344311","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Grasp of Hadar","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that deals damage and has a range of 10+ feet. When you cast that spell, you can move that creature in a straight line 10 feet closer to you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sae3fb9dbbf813a3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Extended Kinesis","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use your kinetic shape with an infusion that makes it last more than 1 round, you can spend 1 kinesis point to double its duration, to a maximum duration of 24 hours.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/time/hourglass-yellow-green.webp","_id":"safca6fb622e651c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591072,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Enhanced Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This magic weapon grants a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with it.</p><p>The bonus increases to +2 when you reach 10th level in this class. This bonus is subject to the enhancement bonus limit from items.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"safd8708b1ac177b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Protection of the Talisman","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When the wearer of your talisman fails a Saving Throw, they can add a d4 to the roll, potentially turning the save into a success. This benefit can be used a number of times equal to your Proficiency bonus, and all expended uses are restored when you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"sb0dfc47bc31e0dd","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Tomb of Levistus","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Reaction when you take damage, you can entomb yourself in ice, which melts away at the end of your next turn. You gain 10 temporary hit points per warlock level, which take as much of the triggering damage as possible. Immediately after you take the damage, you gain vulnerability to fire damage, your Speed is reduced to 0, and you are Incapacitated. These effects, including any remaining temporary hit points, all end when the ice melts.</p><p>Once you use this invocation, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sb1a5cbe1eb5d582","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of Bloated Agony","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you curse a creature that you can see within 30 feet of you, causing its body to swell until the end of your next turn. For the duration, the creature has Disadvantage on strength checks and Dexterity checks, and takes 1d8 necrotic damage each time it makes an attack.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> This curse lasts for 1 minute. The cursed creature can make a Constitution Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/voodoo-doll-pain-damage-tan.webp","_id":"sb33f4451be4a5ab","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591053,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Protection","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature you can see attacks a target other than you that is within 5 feet of you, you can use your Reaction to impose Disadvantage on the Attack Roll. You must be wielding a shield.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when a creature you can see attacks a target other than you that is within 5 feet of you"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-deflect-gold.webp","_id":"sb549cdec1d0e0a1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Push","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature that is no more than 1 size category larger than you with this weapon, you can force it to make a STR Saving Throw or move it 5 ft in a direction you choose.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/sonic/explosion-impact-shock-wave.webp","_id":"sb5cd8591cc0a9ac","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Overwhelm","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature that is no more than 1 size category larger than you with this weapon, you can force it to make a STR or DEX Saving Throw (target's choice). On a failure, the target cannot take Reactions or Bonus Actions (your choice) until the start of your next turn</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sb7048f6348d30eb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"One with Shadows","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you are in an area of dim light or darkness, you can use your action to become Invisible for 1 hour or until you attack, cast a spell, or enter an area of bright light.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/silhouette-stealth-shadow.webp","_id":"sb8165131cf0d692","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Unarmored Defense","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While using your Unarmored Defense or similar permanent feature that alters the calculation for your AC, you have a number of temporary hitpoints equal to its AC, which stack with any other form of temporary hitpoints. You can regain any lost temporary hitpoints from this feature when you finish a Short or a Long Rest by expending 5 sp per temporary hitpoint.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-hold-change-blue.webp","_id":"sb9531151b51bc94","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591053,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Concuss","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can force it to make a CON Saving Throw. On a failure, the target is Deafened until the start of your next turn and makes Concentration Saving Throws with Disadvantage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sbaf456b70074c0c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Claw of Acamar","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The reach of your pact weapon increases by 5 ft. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with your pact weapon, you can force it to make an Intelligence Saving Throw. The DC equals 8 + Proficiency + your spellcasting ability + the weapon's enhancement bonus. On a failed save, the target's Speed is reduced to 0 and it cannot take Reactions until the start of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sbba0cfb86e2978b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Tactical Assessment","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you make an Intelligence (Investigation), an Intelligence (History), or a Wisdom (Insight) check, you can expend one superiority die and add the superiority die to the Ability Check.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sbbc47a76f944b33","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Superior Pact Weapon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can use any weapon you summon with your Pact of the Blade feature as a spellcasting focus for your warlock spells.</p><p>In addition, the weapon gains a +2 bonus to its attack and damage rolls, stacking with existing bonuses on the weapon except other Pact Weapon invocations, up to a maximum of +5 for the Attack Roll bonus.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/weapons-crossed-swords-white-blue.webp","_id":"sbddd2e048d93ab3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Quick Toss","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend one superiority die and make a ranged attack with a weapon that has the thrown property. You can draw the weapon as part of making this attack. If you hit, add the superiority die to the weapon's damage roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sbf1654c9f3ebe19","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Clench of the North Wind","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 3 ki points to cast Rime's Binding Ice.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sbf726d899bb0333","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Burning Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you damage a creature with your kinetic shape, you can force it to make a Dexterity Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failure, the target is set ablaze, burning for fire damage equal to double your Proficiency modifier at the start of each of its turns.</p><p>It can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success. Alternatively, it or another creature can use an Action to douse the flames.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sbfc39ca66ba7c40","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Slow","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can force it to make a CON Saving Throw or halve its Speed until beginning of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sbfc99b993b22284","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Seeking Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Using divination magic, you grant your projectile the ability to seek out a target. When you use this option, you don't make an Attack Roll for the attack. Instead, choose one creature you have seen in the past minute. The projectile flies toward that creature, moving around corners if necessary and ignoring three-quarters cover and half cover. If the target is within the weapon's range and there is a path large enough for the projectile to travel to the target, the target must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. Otherwise, the projectile disappears after traveling as far as it can. On a failed save, the target takes damage as if it were hit by the projectile, plus an extra D6 x your Proficiency force damage, and you learn the target's current location. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage, and you don't learn its location.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-yellow-red.webp","_id":"sbfd6299dea6fcbd","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Rebuke of the Talisman","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When the wearer of your talisman is hit by an attacker you can see within 30 feet of you, you can use your Reaction to deal psychic damage to the attacker equal to half your Warlock level and push it up to 10 feet away from the talisman's wearer.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sc0b94d7a72dfcf7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Subtle Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you cast a spell, you can spend 1 sorcery point to cast it without any somatic, verbal and material components, unless that material component has a cost or is consumed by the spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you cast a spell"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/slimes/slime-movement-swirling-blue.webp","_id":"sc2dab35df8e6ca1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Eldritch Spear","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that deals damage and has a range of 10+ feet. When you cast that spell, its range increases by a number of feet equal to 30 times your Warlock level.</p><p><strong>Repeatable.</strong> You can gain this invocation more than once. Each time you do so, choose a different eligible cantrip.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/unholy/strike-hand-glow-pink.webp","_id":"sc375a2e5b1b63b2","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Magic Resistance (EI)","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Advantage on Saving Throws against spells and other magical effects.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/defensive/shield-barrier-glowing-blue.webp","_id":"sc4053ae9dbcec64","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Boots of the Winding Path","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing these boots, a creature can teleport up to 15 feet as a Bonus Action to an unoccupied space the creature can see. The creature must have occupied that space at some point during the current turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sc4d25c46faf609e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Foxfire Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 1 kinesis points to cast Faerie Fire, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sc53995b1d3a8e32","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Herald of Storms","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 7 kinesis points to cast Whirlwind, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/lightning/bolt-strike-smoke-yellow.webp","_id":"sc589ccea76fe148","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Beast Speech","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Speak with Animals at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/mammals/beast-horned-scaled-glowing-orange.webp","_id":"sc685cd87198f208","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Goading Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to goad the target into attacking you. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and the target must make a Wisdom Saving Throw. On a failed save, the target has Disadvantage on all Attack Rolls against targets other than you until the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sc6c946a3ac8fbe9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Trip Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to knock the target down. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and if the target is no more than 1 size larger than you, it must make a Strength Saving Throw. On a failed save, you knock the target Prone.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sc6eeabaaced8a8a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Vitality","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Constitution score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. At 11th level in this class, both bonuses increase to 4. You can have only one Ability Score-increasing mutagen active on you at a time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sc848acfe05364cd","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Size Increase","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon's size increases to large and its hitpoints increase by an amount equal to your summoner level.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-grow-shrink-blue.webp","_id":"sca2073ab9861565","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gaze of Two Minds","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can use a Bonus Action to touch a willing creature and perceive through its senses until the end of your next turn. As long as the creature is on the same plane of existence as you, you can take a Bonus Action on subsequent turns to maintain this connection, extending the duration until the end of your next turn. The connection ends if you don't maintain it in this way.</p><p>While perceiving through the other creature's senses, you benefit from any special senses possessed by that creature, and you can cast spells as if you were in your space or the other creature's space if the two of you are within 60 feet of each other.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp","_id":"scbf74ba8a6d365e","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Skywalker","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 6 kinesis points to cast Wind Walk, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"scc2e2d26a4a5169","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Breath","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can breathe underwater and gain a Swim Speed equal to your Speed. At 11th level in this class, your Swim Speed is doubled.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"scdef8b35af6ec32","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fist of Four Thunders","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 2 ki points to cast Thunderwave.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/lightning/bolt-strike-smoke-yellow.webp","_id":"sd04b141d119372c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Thrown Weapon Fighting","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can draw a weapon that has the thrown property as part of the attack you make with the weapon.</p><p>In addition, when you hit with a ranged attack using a thrown weapon, you gain a +2 bonus to the damage roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-dagger-white-orange.webp","_id":"sd0f13083a19dd8d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Banishing Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You use abjuration magic to try to temporarily banish your target to a harmless demiplane. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x Proficiency extra force damage and must succeed on a Charisma Saving Throw or be banished. While banished in this way, the target is Incapacitated. At the end of its next turn, the target reappears in the space it vacated or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sd151b384d03e783","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Conversant","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Intelligence score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. At 11th level in this class, both bonuses increase to 4. You can have only one Ability Score-increasing mutagen active on you at a time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sd2ddbc815d95b98","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of Exposure","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When a creature you can see within 30 feet of you takes damage, you can use your Reaction to temporarily weaken its resilience. Until the end of the target's next turn, it loses Resistance to all the damage types dealt by the triggering effect (including for that triggering effect).</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> This curse lasts for 1 minute. The cursed creature can make a Constitution Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself at the end of its next turn on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when a creature you can see within 30 feet of you takes damage"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/unholy/strike-body-life-soul-purple.webp","_id":"sd3de5aac1a53e20","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Lifedrinker","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with your pact weapon you can deal 1d8 extra damage to it. You choose the damage type when you select this invocation from the following options: acid, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, psychic, or radiant. Once per turn, when you deal damage with this invocation, you regain a hit die. You can then choose to spend this hit die immediately, regaining hit points as if you had taken a rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sd5010355f88445d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ride the Wind","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 ki points to cast Fly, targeting yourself.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when you jump or take fall damage"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/debuff-energy-hold-levitate-blue-yellow.webp","_id":"sd54fa3c22e7bd4d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591055,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Aspect of the Moon","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You no longer need to sleep and can't be forced to sleep by any means. To gain the benefits of a Short Rest, you can spend all 8 hours doing light activity, such as reading your Book of Shadows and keeping watch.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sd5ed802534e3301","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"The Master's Presence","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As an Action, you can exude your patron's frightening presence in a radius of 60 feet. Every creature of your choice in the area that is aware of you, must make a Wisdom Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, it is Frightened of you for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. If a creature's Saving Throw is successful or the effect ends for it, the creature is Immune to your Frightful Presence for the next 24 hours.</p><p>You cannot use this feature again until you have finished a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sd7b96166ae7dda1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Alluring","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Charisma score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. At 11th level in this class, both bonuses increase to 4. You can have only one Ability Score-increasing mutagen active on you at a time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sd9432a066c9345c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"One with the Earth","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Meld into Stone, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"sd96a863068d9817","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of Binding","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you attempt to bind a Large or smaller creature you can see within 30 feet of you, which must make a Strength Saving Throw. On a failure, the cursed creature's Speed is reduced to 0 and it can't use Reactions until the end of your next turn.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> This curse lasts for 1 minute and can affect any creature regardless of size. The cursed creature can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the curse on itself at the end of your next turn on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"bonus","cost":1,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"str","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/debuff-chains-orb-movement-blue.webp","_id":"sd987598f6a0a44a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591053,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Trickster's Escape","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Freedom of Movement once on yourself without expending a spell slot. You regain the ability to do so when you finish a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sd99e523e9c9cb08","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Mace of Dispater","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The damage die of your pact weapon increases by one size. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with your pact weapon, you can force it to make a Wisdom Saving Throw. The DC equals 8 + Proficiency + your spellcasting ability + the weapon's enhancement bonus. On a failed save, the target is Frightened until the start of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sd9e146a494844c9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Menacing Attack","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, you can expend one superiority die to attempt to frighten the target. You add the superiority die to the attack's damage roll, and the target must make a Wisdom Saving Throw. On a failed save, it is Frightened of you until the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sda0228a37eafb68","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Armor of Magical Strength","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This armor has 6 charges. The wearer can expend the armor's charges in the following ways:</p><ul><li>When the wearer makes a Strength check or a Strength Saving Throw, it can expend 1 charge to add a bonus to the roll equal to its Intelligence modifier.</li><li>If the creature would be knocked Prone, it can use its Reaction to expend 1 charge to avoid being knocked prone.</li></ul><p>The armor regains 1d6 expended charges daily at dawn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"sda911915bcc4bf4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Seeking Spell","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>If you make an Attack Roll for a spell and miss, you can spend 1 sorcery point to reroll the d20, and you must use the new roll.</p><p>You can use Seeking Spell even if you have already used a different Metamagic option during the casting of the spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"when you make an Attack Roll for a spell and miss"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/movement/trail-streak-zigzag-teal.webp","_id":"sda99a43df00187b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591073,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Commander's Strike","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can forgo one of your attacks to direct one of your companions to strike. When you do so, choose a friendly creature who can see or hear you and expend one superiority die. That creature can immediately use its Reaction to make one weapon attack, adding the superiority die to the attack's damage roll.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sdc791c8eb246c18","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"River of Hungry Flame","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 5 ki points to cast Wall of Fire.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sdc9d576dc4467cc","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ranged Attacks","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength or Dexterity by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Your Eidolon gains a ranged natural weapon attack with a range of 80/320. The damage die of this attack is identical to its other natural attacks and uses the same ability score for attack and damage rolls.</p><p>You can choose the damage type of the ranged attack from one of the following: acid, bludgeoning, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, piercing, poison, radiant, slashing, or thunder.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/tail-strike-bone-orange.webp","_id":"sddfdf98eee6220b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591058,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gash","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can force it to make a CON Saving Throw or take damage equal to your Proficiency at the start of its next turn for 1 minute. At the end of each of its turns it can repeat the Saving Throw, ending the effect on a success.</p><p>While under the effect of Gash, the amount of healing the target receives is halved.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sdef395f4539d8bb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Cruelty","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>For 10 minutes, you can make one additional attack when you take the Attack action.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sdeff4be7305185b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shroud of Shadow","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Invisibility at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/silhouette-stealth-shadow.webp","_id":"sdf7adee97276e34","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Elemental Attunement","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can use your action to briefly control elemental forces within 30 feet of you, causing one of the following effects of your choice:</p><ul><li>Create a harmless, instantaneous sensory effect related to air, earth, fire, or water, such as a shower of sparks, a puff of wind, a spray of light mist, or a gentle rumbling of stone.</li><li>Instantaneously light or snuff out a candle, a torch, or a small campfire.</li><li>Chill or warm up to 1 pound of nonliving material for up to 1 hour.</li><li>Cause earth, fire, water, or mist that can fit within a 1-foot cube to shape itself into a crude form you designate for 1 minute.</li></ul>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/silhouette-hold-change-blue.webp","_id":"se059de9a9a4abba","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591055,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Empowered Kinesis","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you roll damage for your kinetic shape, you can spend 1 kinesis point to reroll a number of the damage dice up to your Charisma modifier (minimum of one). You must use the new rolls.</p><p>You can use Empowered Kinesis even if you have already used a different Metakinesis option during the casting of the spell.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"util","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/air/wind-tornado-wall-blue.webp","_id":"se114e8b5a7c69ae","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591072,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Reconstruction","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While you have at least 1 hit point, you can expend a Hit Die and regain hit points as if you had taken a Rest at the beginning of each of your turns.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/heart-glowing-red.webp","_id":"se14c568f0c971de","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Beguiling Shot","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your enchantment magic causes this projectile to temporarily beguile its target. The creature hit by the projectile takes D6 x Proficiency extra psychic damage, and choose one of your allies within 30 feet of the target. The target must succeed on a Wisdom Saving Throw, or it is Charmed by the chosen ally for 1 minute. The target can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/control-influence-rally-purple.webp","_id":"se29b2300b2bd5db","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Pact of the Talisman","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your patron gives you an amulet, a talisman that can aid the wearer when the need is great. When the wearer fails an Ability Check, they can add a d4 to the roll, potentially turning the roll into a success. This benefit can be used a number of times equal to your Proficiency bonus, and all expended uses are restored when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>If you lose the talisman, you can perform a 1-hour ceremony to receive a replacement from your patron. This ceremony can be performed during a Short or a Long Rest, and it destroys the previous amulet. The talisman turns to ash when you die.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/scrolls/scroll-symbol-circle-white.webp","_id":"se2b52e9c3d9df13","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Venomous Attacks","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Creatures hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks have to make a CON Saving Throw against your spell save DC. On failure, the target creature is Poisoned. A poisoned creature takes poison damage equal to twice your Proficiency at the start of each of its turns.</p><p>At the end of each of its turns, the creature can repeat the Saving Throw, ending the condition on a success.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"special","cost":null,"condition":"creatures hit by your Eidolon's natural weapon attacks"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[["2 * @prof","poison"]],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/abilities/stinger-poison-green.webp","_id":"se37b4c05e87d1b4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591059,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Cloak of Flies","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you can surround yourself with a magical aura that looks like buzzing flies. The aura extends 5 feet from you in every direction, but not through total cover. It lasts until you're Incapacitated or you dismiss it as a Bonus Action.</p><p>The aura grants you Advantage on Charisma (Intimidation) checks but Disadvantage on all other Charisma checks. Any other creature that starts or enters for the first time on its turn in the aura takes poison damage equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of 0 damage).</p><p>Once you use this invocation, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"se56c024d0bad9ad","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Cloud Rune","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>This rune emulates the deceptive magic used by some cloud giants. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with this rune, you have Advantage on Dexterity (Sleight of Hand) checks and Charisma (Deception) checks.</p><p>In addition, when you or a creature you can see within 30 feet of you is hit by an Attack Roll, you can use your Reaction to invoke the rune and choose a different creature within 30 feet of you, other than the attacker. The chosen creature becomes the target of the attack, using the same roll. This magic can transfer the attack's effects regardless of the attack's range. Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/movement/feet-winged-boots-brown.webp","_id":"se5a392a4da9c09b","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Empowered Arts","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you roll damage for a spell, you can spend a number of Ki points up to your Wisdom modifier to reroll a number of damage dice equal to the number of Ki points expended. You can then reroll the weapon damage die on a number of Unarmed Attacks you make this turn, up to the number of Ki points expended. You must use the new rolls.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"se62be56502179c8","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Homunculus Servant","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You learn intricate methods for magically creating a special homunculus that serves you. The item you infuse serves as the creature's heart, around which the creature's body instantly forms.</p><p>You determine the homunculus's appearance. Some artificers prefer mechanical-looking birds, whereas some like winged vials or miniature, animate cauldrons.</p><p>The homunculus is friendly to you and your companions, and it obeys your commands. See this creature's game statistics in the Homunculus Servant stat block, which uses your Proficiency bonus (PB) in several places.</p><p>In combat, the homunculus shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It can move and use its Reaction on its own, but the only action it takes on its turn is the Dodge action, unless you take a Bonus Action on your turn to command it to take another action. That action can be one in its stat block or some other action. If you are Incapacitated, the homunculus can take any action of its choice, not just Dodge.</p><p>The homunculus regains 2d6 hit points if the Mending spell is cast on it. If you or the homunculus dies, it vanishes, leaving its heart in its space.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"se63b85bf9089dd9","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Whispers of the Grave","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Speak with Dead at will, without expending a spell slot.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"se7016c52ceeda6d","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Watery Prison","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 4 kinesis points to cast Watery Sphere, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/water-hand.webp","_id":"se7a405dcd45ead1","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Repelling Blast","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Choose one of your known Warlock cantrips that requires an Attack Roll. When you hit a Large or smaller creature with that cantrip, you can push the creature up to 10 feet straight away from you.</p><p><strong>Repeatable.</strong> You can gain this invocation more than once. Each time you do so, choose a different eligible cantrip.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sea0ec4eb44ccb89","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blind Fighting","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have blindsight with a range of 10 feet. Within that range, you can effectively see anything that isn't behind total cover, even if you're Blinded or in darkness. Moreover, you can see an Invisible creature within that range, unless the creature successfully hides from you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye-tan.webp","_id":"seca00667ae01da3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Sagacity","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Wisdom score increases by 2, as does your maximum for that score. At 11th level in this class, both bonuses increase to 4. You can have only one Ability Score-increasing mutagen active on you at a time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sed283b53f5ebf35","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Druidic Warrior","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You learn two cantrips of your choice from the druid spell list. They count as ranger spells for you, and Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for them. Whenever you gain a level in this class, you can replace one of these cantrips with another cantrip from the druid spell list.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/nature/hand-weapon-wood-bark-brown.webp","_id":"sf06ca8f226c5d70","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591070,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Parry","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When another creature damages you with a melee attack, you can use your Reaction and expend one superiority die to reduce the damage by the number you roll on your superiority die + STR or DEX modifier (your choice) + fighter level.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sf0a5dd572b832ae","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Gift of Water","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Create Or Destroy Water at-will, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/water-hand.webp","_id":"sf38ce530297dceb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Chain Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you damage a creature with your kinetic shape, you can spend 3 kinesis points to make another attack with your kinetic blast against a different creature within 60 feet of your original target. The damage of your kinetic blast is halved for this attack.</p><p>If the attack hits, you can choose to spend 1 kinesis point to target another creature within 30 feet of your second target, which cannot be your original target. You roll the attack as you did before, and halve your kinetic blast damage.</p><p>You can repeat this as long as your attacks hit, you have new targets in range to chain to, and kinesis points to spend.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sf397095b2d40f7c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Blood Curse of the Blackened Gaze","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Reaction, when a creature you can see within 30 feet of you makes a weapon attack, you can cause that attack to have Disadvantage. If the attack still hits, the target creature takes half damage from it. This curse has no effect on creatures that do not rely on sight or are otherwise Immune to the Blinded condition.</p><p><strong>Amplify.</strong> The target creature has to make a Constitution save or be Blinded until the end of your next turn.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"reaction","cost":1,"condition":"when a creature you can see within 30 feet of you makes a weapon attack"},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":1,"width":null,"units":"","type":"creature"},"range":{"value":30,"long":null,"units":"ft"},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":"save","attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"con","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp","_id":"sf598950021ed031","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591054,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ascendant Step","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Levitate on yourself at will, without expending a spell slot or material components.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sf6c7b73cdeb88b7","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Misty Visions","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Silent Image at will, without expending a spell slot or material components.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/perception/eye-ringed-glow-angry-small-teal.webp","_id":"sf6edb456a1f9129","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Shielded","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You have Resistance to slashing damage. You can have only mutagen that grants you a Resistance active at one time.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/equipment/shield/heater-stone-orange.webp","_id":"sf76b71e5d74d9d4","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Bowling Infusion","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you damage a creature with your kinetic shape, you can force it to make a Strength Saving Throw against your save DC. On a failure, the creature is knocked Prone.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sf806e324ea2715c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Maddening Hex","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As a Bonus Action, you cause a psychic disturbance around the target cursed by your Hex spell or by a warlock feature of yours, such as Hexblade's Curse or Sign of Ill Omen. When you do so, you deal psychic damage to the cursed target and each creature of your choice that you can see within 5 feet of it. The psychic damage equals your Charisma modifier (minimum of 1 damage). To use this invocation, you must be able to see the cursed target, and it must be within 30 feet of you.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sf8a6dd91ad00297","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Curse Bringer","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>The damage die of your pact weapon increases by one size. Once per turn, when you hit a creature with your pact weapon, you can force it to make a Charisma Saving Throw. The DC equals 8 + Proficiency + your spellcasting ability + the weapon's enhancement bonus. On a failed save, the target is cursed until the start of your next turn. While the target is cursed, it has to roll a d4 every time it makes an Attack Roll or Saving Throw and subtract the result from the total.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sf8ac73bd5a88880","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Ghostly Gaze","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>As an Action, you gain the ability to see through solid objects to a range of 30 feet. Within that range, you have darkvision if you don't already have it. This special sight lasts for 1 minute or until your Concentration ends (as if you were concentrating on a spell). During that time, you perceive objects as ghostly, transparent images.</p><p>Once you use this invocation, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sf92d5971d6deb04","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Water Whip","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 2 ki points as an Action to create a whip of water that shoves and pulls a creature to unbalance it. A creature that you can see that is within 30 feet of you must make a Dexterity Saving Throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d10 bludgeoning damage, plus an extra 1d10 bludgeoning damage for each additional ki point you spend, and you can either knock it Prone or pull it up to 25 feet closer to you. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage, and you don't pull it or knock it Prone.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/water/water-hand.webp","_id":"sf9b44d0244436c5","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fury of the Earth","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 8 kinesis points to cast Earthquake, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/earth/projectile-stone-landslide.webp","_id":"sf9dbf963bf5fea6","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Immortal Flame","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can cast Continual Flame at-will, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sfa1f23c495b9b86","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Kinetic Healer","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You gain the ability to harness the cleansing properties of water.</p><p>As an Action, you can touch a creature and spend a number of kinesis points up to the current total you possess and heal the creature. For each kinesis point you spend the creature is healed for 2d8 hitpoints. You can also spend 2 kinesis points to remove any one poison or disease from the creature as part of the same action.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/life/heart-glowing-red.webp","_id":"sfa37133c6f6ea07","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Back to Back","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you're within 5 feet of a creature on your turn, you can expend one superiority die and optionally switch places with that creature, provided you spend at least 5 feet of movement, the creature is willing, and isn't Incapacitated. This movement doesn't provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p><p>Roll the superiority die. Until the start of your next turn, you or the other creature (your choice) gains a bonus to AC equal to the number rolled. This effect ends early if either of you become Incapacitated or you are more than 5 feet away from each other. The AC bonus from this maneuver does not stack with that from Evasive Footwork.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/strike-flail-destructive-yellow.webp","_id":"sfab61836a614428","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fierce Charge","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Increase your Eidolon's Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution by 1, up to a maximum of 20.</p><p>Once your turn, when your Eidolon moves towards a creature in a straight line for the first time, it can add 1 dmg for every 5 ft spent as part of that movement to the first melee weapon damage roll it makes against that creature.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/creatures/magical/humanoid-horned-rider.webp","_id":"sfac588db77c9fcb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591057,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Unarmed Fighting","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>Your Unarmed Strikes can deal bludgeoning damage equal to 1d6 + your Strength modifier on a hit. If you aren't wielding any weapons or a shield when you make the Attack Roll, the d6 becomes a d8.</p><p>At the start of each of your turns, you can deal 1d4 bludgeoning damage to one creature Grappled by you.</p><p>If you have another feature or effect that modifies the die size of your unarmed attacks, that die size instead increases by 1 step, or by 2 steps if you are not wielding a shield or weapon.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/skills/melee/unarmed-punch-fist-blue.webp","_id":"sfc270730094c7cb","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1777210591069,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Call of Gravity","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>You can spend 2 kinesis points to cast Earthbind, but using only a somatic component.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/symbols/cog-shield-white-blue.webp","_id":"sfc28f92d3537b7a","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Medium","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>While wearing this armor, you have a number of temporary hitpoints equal to its AC, which stack with any other form of temporary hitpoints. You regain any lost temporary hitpoints from this feature when you finish a Short or a Long Rest by expending 5 sp per temporary hitpoint.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/sundries/documents/document-torn-diagram-tan.webp","_id":"sfdf993381ac8bc3","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
{"name":"Fangs of the Fire Snake","type":"feat","system":{"description":{"value":"<p>When you use the Attack action on your turn, you can spend 1 ki point to cause tendrils of flame to stretch out from your fists and feet. Your reach with your Unarmed Strikes increases by 10 feet until the start of your next turn. A hit with such an attack deals fire damage instead of bludgeoning damage. If you spend 1 additional ki point when you use this feature, all Unarmed Strikes until the start of your next turn also deal an additional 1d6 fire damage.</p>","chat":"","unidentified":""},"source":"","activation":{"type":"","cost":null,"condition":""},"duration":{"value":"","units":""},"cover":null,"crewed":false,"target":{"value":null,"width":null,"units":"","type":""},"range":{"value":null,"long":null,"units":""},"uses":{"value":null,"max":"","per":null,"recovery":""},"consume":{"type":"","target":null,"amount":null},"ability":null,"actionType":null,"attackBonus":"","chatFlavor":"","critical":{"threshold":null,"damage":""},"damage":{"parts":[],"versatile":""},"formula":"","save":{"ability":"","dc":null,"scaling":"spell"},"type":{"value":"","subtype":""},"requirements":"","recharge":{"value":null,"charged":null}},"img":"icons/magic/fire/elemental-fire-humanoid.webp","_id":"sfe241e41c00312c","_stats":{"systemId":"dnd5e","systemVersion":"2.4.9","coreVersion":"10.303","createdTime":1777072572464,"modifiedTime":1785969175120,"lastModifiedBy":"dnd5ebuilder0000"},"flags":{},"sort":0}
